\chapter{Numerical Stability at Planck Length}
We enforce:
\[
\Delta x = a_{\text{Pl}}, \quad
\Delta t = \frac{a_{\text{Pl}}}{c}.
\]

Stability requires:
\[
\frac{\Delta t}{\Delta x} = \frac{1}{c}.
\]

